1. Where  an  accreditation  is  granted  in  accordance  with  Article  18,  the  verifier  shall  submit  a  request  for registration in the CBAM registry to the competent authority of the Member State in which the national accreditation body is established. The verifier shall submit the request for registration within two months of the date on which the accreditation was granted, but not before 1 September 2026. The competent authority shall register the information on the  accredited  verifier  in  the  CBAM  registry.
